[01:07.87] The path is clear, though no eyes can see
[01:13.65] The course laid down long before
[01:16.50] 
[01:21.92] And so with gods and men, the sheep remain inside their pen
[01:24.12] 
[01:28.80] Though many times they've seen the way to leave
[01:31.08] 
[01:37.55] He rides majestic, past homes of men
[01:39.78] 
[01:43.41] Who care not or gaze with joy
[01:45.74] 
[01:51.67] To see reflected there, the trees, the sky, the lily fair
[01:54.04] 
