[02:07.81] 
[02:13.19] Like a cancer growth is removed by skill
[02:15.64] 
[02:20.09] Let it be revealed
[02:22.68] 
[02:26.47] A waterfall, his madrigal
[02:29.29] 
[02:33.81] An inland sea, his symphony
[02:36.71] 
[02:53.93] Undinal songs urge the sailors on
[02:57.42] 
[03:00.41] 'Till lured by the siren's cry...
